129	2_Standard_Operating_Procedures.pdf	11	ing Procedures\n10. SOP — Customer Complaint & Cargo Claim Handling\nTrigger: A customer reports a problem — damaged/missing cargo, billing dispute, mis\ning Procedures\n10. SOP — Customer Complaint & Cargo Claim Handling\nTrigger: A customer reports a problem — damaged/missing cargo, billing dispute, missed delivery.\nResponsible Role: Customer Support, escalating to Warehouse/Finance/Dispatch as relevant.\nSteps: \n1. Log the complaint with the relevant reference number (shipment_no, invoice_no, or receipt_no).\n2. Pull the relevant records (shipment history, delivery report, warehouse receipt, or invoice) to verify the facts \nbefore responding.\n3. For cargo loss/damage claims, confirm whether the shipment was insured (is_insured) before discussing \ncompensation.\n4. Route billing disputes to Finance and cargo damage/loss claims to Warehouse Operations or Claims \nmanagement for resolution — front-line staff do not approve compensation directly.\n5. Communicate the resolution timeline to the customer and update the complaint record upon resoluti	[-0.012389903,0.01432216,0.01207486,-0.062971465,0.00019361818,0.0069933063,-0.013149247,0.017271012,-0.008623401,0.002189662,-0.0097932,-0.019806033,0.021475714,-0.009370933,0.11058833,-0.0052295867,0.0073265852,0.029171662,-0.0021614472,-0.013947733,-0.0095950905,0.0024151267,-0.020663833,-0.005083356,-0.0032675476,-0.0021536045,-0.0039490606,0.011125691,0.013339038,-0.01096138,-0.011932904,0.0032049054,0.0034182617,0.022692295,0.0042772694,0.030207055,-0.016656758,0.002454204,-0.006874965,0.021582933,-0.022880984,0.026341565,0.0128026465,-0.004533813,-0.01586755,-0.008377841,0.009489515,-0.0053811064,-0.012663969,-0.00024231603,0.00067184627,-0.0078044413,-0.018422749,-0.21392556,-0.012625846,-0.018663472,-0.0044413083,-0.01985265,0.003957457,-0.004334919,-0.017580478,0.017301818,-0.021808874,-0.0019521913,-0.008280053,-0.010824254,0.015960705,0.014210354,-0.007684053,-0.015