134	3_Code_of_Conduct.pdf	2	s in \nSection 12.\n2. Professionalism & Customer Service\n● Treat every customer, regardless of account size or shipment value, with courtesy, patience,\ns in \nSection 12.\n2. Professionalism & Customer Service\n● Treat every customer, regardless of account size or shipment value, with courtesy, patience, and respect — \nincluding customers who are frustrated about a delay, billing issue, or damaged shipment.\n● Communicate clearly and honestly about shipment status, costs, and timelines. Never promise a delivery \ndate, discount, or compensation that has not been confirmed through the proper process.\n● Escalate issues you cannot resolve rather than guessing or giving a customer inaccurate information to end \nthe conversation quickly.\n3. Honesty, Integrity & Accurate Record-Keeping\n● All entries into Company systems — shipment status, warehouse receipts, invoices, delivery reports — \nmust accurately reflect what actually happened. Never log a delivery as complete, a release as authorized, \nor a payment as received before it has actually occurr	[-0.011979673,0.008367348,0.0058459872,-0.053844504,-0.0007779059,0.01014026,-0.0020873751,0.012644856,-0.004599846,0.0013892261,0.00035099612,-0.021151394,0.013238761,-0.008630929,0.1071132,0.0070038503,0.00715899,0.015461844,-0.011368644,-0.0066834744,0.0075793616,0.0069046416,-0.013012132,0.0051142196,0.008446393,-0.012956763,0.0007389117,0.011142828,0.025008962,0.010032536,-0.0066348766,-0.007844679,0.0074197724,0.017802376,0.016668582,0.019087065,-0.008699244,-0.009777884,-0.01460433,0.00886907,-0.021351893,0.025643695,0.011551306,0.00045339152,-0.013462357,-0.0057162684,0.04505667,0.006810592,-0.02007713,0.0010413231,-0.008078788,0.0020066202,-0.007452257,-0.20805523,-0.010077898,-0.022838818,-0.012513952,-0.011101805,0.002309535,-0.006688123,-0.0011799457,0.015437861,-0.030929588,-0.0059598126,-0.010233715,1.12481675e-05,0.018638982,-0.0054893414,-0.0048503615,0.0007917112,-0.01328961