139	3_Code_of_Conduct.pdf	7	nsafe conditions, near-misses, or accidents to a supervisor immediately, regardless of fault.\n8.2 Driver-Specific Conduct\n● Drivers must hold a valid,\nnsafe conditions, near-misses, or accidents to a supervisor immediately, regardless of fault.\n8.2 Driver-Specific Conduct\n● Drivers must hold a valid, current commercial license appropriate to the vehicle operated, and must not \noperate a vehicle while its status is marked Maintenance.\n● Drivers must not operate a vehicle while fatigued, under the influence of alcohol or drugs, or in violation of \napplicable hours-of-service regulations.\n● Cargo must be secured, handled, and transported in line with its declared nature; drivers must report any \ndamage or tampering discovered en route immediately.\nPage 4 of 6\nPremier Logistics — Code of Conduct\nPage 5 of 6\nPremier Logistics — Code of Conduct\n9. Use of Company Systems, Assets & AI Tools\n● Company systems (database, dispatch tools, the AI customer assistant, communication platforms) are \nprovided for legitimate business use. Do not use them	[0.00096485356,0.015030164,0.0013846395,-0.048041727,0.0014918344,-0.005770225,-0.00419986,-0.004480969,0.010775248,-0.01736592,0.0007163725,-0.017655084,-0.0072459835,-0.015020929,0.12801659,0.008452632,0.011905913,-0.0034329614,0.0030449647,0.0039224075,-0.009663982,-0.013472351,0.002393454,-0.003470925,0.002154529,-0.0148107335,0.021259496,0.017007101,0.032858074,0.0069703767,0.0010591045,-0.0076585547,0.010159917,0.03540854,0.0045322403,0.009158299,-0.0009213931,-0.015545625,-0.013685793,-0.0071770335,-0.016965704,0.0308692,-0.013753858,-0.0016574644,-0.014762185,0.007622071,0.019515576,0.0004538387,-0.018890116,0.0031137438,-0.0038923414,0.0028874625,-0.006686505,-0.19967197,0.008344165,-0.016525371,-0.00850161,-0.0025306814,0.0015530408,-0.010051245,0.0041018766,0.0034255285,-0.0016594096,-0.007002771,0.0043756813,-0.0014624586,0.0041132392,0.010211184,-0.02127112,-0.0009445918,-0.008