145	4_Company_Rules_and_Regulations.pdf	1	Compliance Rules\n9. Safety & Regulatory Compliance Rules\n10. Rule Violations & Consequences\nPage 2 of 5\nPremier Logistics — Company Rules & Regulation\nCompliance Rules\n9. Safety & Regulatory Compliance Rules\n10. Rule Violations & Consequences\nPage 2 of 5\nPremier Logistics — Company Rules & Regulations\n1. Purpose & Precedence\nThis Rules & Regulations document sets out specific, enforceable operational rules — thresholds, timeframes, and \nconditions — that apply across the Company's booking, billing, warehousing, and fleet operations. Where the \nCompany Policies document sets the principle, this document sets the number: the deadline, the fee, the limit.\nThese rules apply to all customers, employees, and contracted parties engaging with Company services, and to any \nsystem (including the Company's AI assistant) that communicates deadlines, fees, or thresholds to a customer — \nsuch communications must match the rules stated here.\n2. Business Hours & Service Availability\n● Standard booking, warehouse, and customer support hours are Monday–	[0.004102053,0.0060829413,0.011889614,-0.053532697,0.016571281,-4.6779887e-06,-0.0030201,-0.0059345285,0.00088920066,-0.019249195,-0.01336451,-0.010829657,0.0007026533,-0.013010951,0.12648587,0.012018945,0.006479462,-0.0035458906,-0.008049032,0.00046216464,-0.000891647,-0.006900678,0.00038235597,0.0035137152,-0.0030570594,-0.008384761,0.03233144,0.0028495626,0.031414427,0.008392528,-0.010516244,-0.017438838,0.011291958,0.015796792,-0.016050711,0.029397026,-0.01841456,-0.0008157936,-0.0039073103,0.003057395,-0.014085161,0.037280504,0.0010837986,0.004121717,-0.008357319,-0.0019844589,0.019421108,-0.020255402,-0.01732079,0.022126658,-0.0031796969,-0.0075918734,-0.008791346,-0.21502444,0.003317361,-0.0013695911,0.00030463873,-0.0064019337,0.013420618,-0.0015694613,-0.011298863,0.015401461,-0.02239372,0.009080883,-0.01603278,0.010304478,0.0066454825,0.0156223625,-0.0033484953,-0.0