149	4_Company_Rules_and_Regulations.pdf	5	late fee requires Finance management approval and must be documented against the invoice \nrecord.\n6. Liability & Cargo Claims Rules\n● The Company's st\nlate fee requires Finance management approval and must be documented against the invoice \nrecord.\n6. Liability & Cargo Claims Rules\n● The Company's standard liability for loss or damage to uninsured cargo is limited to the lesser of the \ndeclared_value on file or the Company's standard per-kilogram liability cap as stated in the customer's \nservice agreement.\n● Full declared-value coverage is available only for shipments where cargo insurance was purchased and \nconfirmed (is_insured = true) prior to pickup.\n● Cargo damage or loss claims must be reported within 7 calendar days of the delivery date (or, for non-\ndelivery, within 7 days of the missed preferred_delivery_date) to be eligible for review.\n● Claims are assessed against the delivery report, warehouse receipt condition notes, and any POD \ndocumentation on file; claims without supporting shipment records cannot be approved.\nPage 4 	[-0.0044865836,0.023214692,0.015415803,-0.057400472,-0.003770593,0.0027744393,-0.000400644,0.012939813,-0.01075671,-0.013414837,-0.003673903,-0.0051471465,-0.00486219,-0.00499575,0.092419036,0.006699713,0.014374677,0.0033035076,-0.01289815,-0.0040254844,-0.009571606,0.014931557,-0.011190781,-0.010007477,-0.0037643025,0.0120868385,0.0010745598,0.006864765,0.021904152,0.011602273,-0.011003125,-0.005738022,0.0051774434,0.013320868,0.009713952,0.033752535,-0.0024483686,-0.003499743,0.0077057173,0.015001551,-0.010412425,0.025422197,0.0145124905,-0.013728066,-0.027244568,-0.003957105,0.002276593,-0.008873399,-0.0042824377,0.00247249,0.00136084,-0.023764541,-0.004193481,-0.21337596,0.0055847173,-0.020366022,-0.029447194,-0.019656789,0.006962881,0.0015397605,-0.01987423,0.03554081,-0.014667333,-0.009130988,-0.005559193,0.004503909,0.00031912062,-0.006093288,-0.024303287,-0.015772667,-0